+## Scenarios traced through the spec
+
+S1. Clean checkout, `make build`. The spec names inputs and outputs (star schema, monthly mart, oracle_map.yml, DECISIONS.md) but not the entry points, the dlt source names, or the model list. Trace stops at "which code runs". Gap N-6.
