+S2. Re-run `make build` on an existing `lake/` and `out/`. "Idempotent" is stated with no definition (full rebuild from raw vs incremental merge). Gap N-7.
+
+S3. Batch money totals. "Exact money sums" with no amount column, no sign rule, no decimal type. Gap G-2. Risk R-1.
